{
  "title": "101: al-Qaarea'h القارعة",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful\nاَلْقَارِعَةُ ۙ‏(1)\nALQAARE-A’TO.\nThe Catastrophe!\nمَا الْقَارِعَةُ ۚ‏(2)\nMAL QAARE-A’H.\nWhat is the Catastrophe?\nوَمَاۤ اَدْرٰٮكَ مَا الْقَارِعَةُ ؕ‏(3)\nWA MAA ADRAAKA MAL QAARE-A’H.\nWhat will show you what is the Catastrophe?\nيَوْمَ يَكُوْنُ النَّاسُ كَالْفَرَاشِ الْمَبْثُوْثِۙ‏(4)\nYAWMA YAKOONUN NAASO KAL-FARAASHIL MABSOOSE.\n[It is] the day when mankind will be like scattered moths\nوَتَكُوْنُ الْجِبَالُ كَالْعِهْنِ الْمَنْفُوْشِؕ‏(5)\nWA TAKOONUL JEBAALO KAL-E’HNIL MANFOOSH.\nand the mountains like carded wool.\nفَاَمَّا مَنْ ثَقُلَتْ مَوَازِيْنُهٗ ۙ‏(6)\nFA-AMMAA MAN SAQOLAT MAWAAZEENOHU.\nAs for him, whose deeds weigh heavy in the scales,\nفَهُوَ فِىْ عِيْشَةٍ رَّاضِيَةٍ ؕ‏(7)\nFAHOWA FEE E’ESHATIR RAAZEYAH.\nhe will have a pleasing life.\nوَاَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَازِيْنُهٗ ۙ‏(8)\nWA AMMAA MAN KHAFFAT MAWAAZEENOHU.\nBut as for him, whose deeds weigh light in the scales,\nفَاُمُّهٗ هَاوِيَةٌ ؕ‏(9)\nFA-UMMOHU HAAWEYAH.\nhis home will be the Abyss.\nوَمَاۤ اَدْرٰٮكَ مَا هِيَهْ ؕ‏(10)\nWA MAA ADRAAKA MAA HEYAH.\nAnd what will show you what it is?\nنَارٌ حَامِيَةٌ‏(11)\nNAARUN HAAMEYAH\nIt is a scorching fire!",
  "merits": "This is a ‘Makki’ Surah which has 11 verses. Imam Muhammad al-Baqir (a.s.) has said that the person who frequently recites this Surah will be saved from the heat of hellfire.\nIf a businessman or a person in financial difficulties keeps this Surah in his possession, the doors of sustenance will be opened to him. Recitation of this Surah in prayers also increases in one’s sustenance. Water in which this Surah has been dissolved is useful in keeping away unwanted pests (e.g. Insects and rodents)."
